Subject: [PATCH] fix(3d): enable verified operations in aligned setups

Allow 3D Pocket and 3D Finish through the existing setup-frame geometry path.
Verify flipped paths, area controls, picks, stock simulation and posted output.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

